  "description": "CR 601.2i, 603.2, 113.6, 115.1d, 105.2c, 306.5b, 606.4: Ugin, Eye of the Storms exiles up to one target colored permanent when it is cast and whenever its controller casts a colorless spell, and its +2 gains 3 life and draws a card",
  "note": "Casting Ugin, itself colorless, triggers only the cast trigger: the colorless-spell trigger works only from the battlefield. Steel Wall is colorless, so it is refused as a target. Alice's Ornithopter triggers Ugin and exiles Hill Giant; Gray Ogre stays, since there is one exile per colorless spell. Alice's green Grizzly Bears triggers nothing, and nor does bob's Ornithopter on his turn. The +2 takes life from 20 to 23, draws one Island and loyalty from 7 to 9.",
